# The same selector, on a pane with a transcript above it. What changes is not
# the widget: it is what else is on the screen for a rule to find a border on,
# and the rules read the topmost one they can see. The same widget has to read
# the same way. The agent is still there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is
# driving this scenario decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen scrolled
sleep 600000
